Subject: [PATCH 03041/11362] =?UTF-8?q?[outer-loop]=20revert=20value=5Fwei?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ght=205->0=20(keep=20the=20wired=20v3=20head=20as=20a=20tiebrea?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ker)=20=E2=80=94=20un-ship=20the=20regression?=
